<div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <h4 class="modal-title">Client Admin Screen Help</h4>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">

        <h3>Client Admin:</h3>
        <h2> How to add a user:</h2>
        <p class="help-text">Navigate to the upper left corner of the dashboard and select <em>Client Users</em>:</p>

        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-1.jpg" />

        <p class="help-text">Next Next click the <em>Add</em> button at the bottom of user list:</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-2.jpg" />

        <h2> How to edit an existing user:</h2>
        <p class="help-text">From the user list, find the user and select <em>edit</em> to the far right:</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-3.jpg" />

        <p class="help-text">Once you select “edit”, you can modify the user information as needed. Once updated, click the <em>save</em> button:</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-4.jpg"  />

        <p class="help-text">
            From the user screen, please fill in appropriate user contact information and be sure to select the proper <em>Role</em> for the user:
        </p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-5.jpg" />

        <p class="help-text">
            Please check the <em> Is Active</em> checkbox for the user to make the account active:
        </p>
        <img class=help-img" src="/assets/help/client-admin-6.jpg" />
        <div class="alert alert-info help-alert alert-dismissible">
            <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close">&times;</a>
            <i class="fa fa-warning"></i> Please note, If you want to disable a user account, uncheck the <em> Is Active</em> checkbox for the user you want to disable.
        </div>

        <p class="help-text">Once done the user will be sent an auto-generated welcome email with further instructions on how to gain access and to set their password.</p>

        <div class="alert alert-info help-alert alert-dismissible">
            <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close">&times;</a>
            <i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i> If you need additional assistance or have questions, please email support at <a href="mailto:answer-support@msr-fsr.com">answer-support@msr-fsr.com</a> <span class="hidden-print">or open a ticket using the button below</span>.
        </div>

    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary pull-left" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#supportModal"><i class="fa fa-life-bouy"></i> Open Ticket</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" onclick="js:window.print()"><i class="fa fa-print"></i> Print Help</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-warning" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-close-o"></i> Close</button>
    </div>
</div>


